   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1089875,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13291125,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Flechas rojas: un solo enlace sincrono Controller <-> Main (si se corta, el reactor queda sin comandos globales).",
   "originalText": "Flechas rojas: un solo enlace sincrono Controller <-> Main (si se corta, el reactor queda sin comandos globales).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "L12e00126",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1800.0,
   "y": 1080.0,
   "width": 123.20000000000002,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "c022",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1097794,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13395854,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "SPOF (Hint)",
   "originalText": "SPOF (Hint)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "L12e00127",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1800.0,
   "y": 1113.0,
   "width": 734.72,
   "height": 160.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "c023",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1105713,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13500583,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Main Controller: unico; si cae no hay decisiones globales ni comandos.\n2. Controller 1/2/3: uno por reactor; si cae, su reactor queda sin control.\n3. Medidor de temperatura: un solo sensor por reactor en el diagrama.\n4. Enlace Controller <-> Main: un solo canal sincrono.\n(Refrigeracion: si no responde, hoy nadie se entera.)\n\nComo se elimina un SPOF: replicas + /health + LB (o primary + replica + failover).\nUn LB solo o un retry solo NO lo eliminan: no agregan redundancia.",
   "originalText": "1. Main Controller: unico; si cae no hay decisiones globales ni comandos.\n2. Controller 1/2/3: uno por reactor; si cae, su reactor queda sin control.\n3. Medidor de temperatura: un solo sensor por reactor en el diagrama.\n4. Enlace Controller <-> Main: un solo canal sincrono.\n(Refrigeracion: si no responde, hoy nadie se entera.)\n\nComo se elimina un SPOF: replicas + /health + LB (o primary + replica + failover).\nUn LB solo o un retry solo NO lo eliminan: no agregan redundancia.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "L12e00128",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1800.0,
   "y": 1320.0,
   "width": 425.6,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "c024",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1113632,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13605312,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Failure scenarios (que pasa si falla?)",
   "originalText": "Failure scenarios (que pasa si falla?)",
   "fontSize": 20,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "L12e00129",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1800.0,
   "y": 1353.0,
   "width": 645.1200000000001,
   "height": 140.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "c025",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1121551,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13710041,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Sensor deja de responder -> sin heartbeat, el Controller sigue a ciegas.\nSensor manda valores erroneos -> decision erronea = desastre.\nController local cae -> refrigeracion y alertas del reactor se pierden.\nMain Controller se desconecta -> ningun reactor recibe comandos.\nRefrigeracion no responde -> no hay confirmacion ni alarma.\nRegistro/trazabilidad: no existe (\"quien prendio o apago que?\").\nLibreria nueva de eventos: si se cambia de golpe, P95/P99 desconocidos.",
   "originalText": "Sensor deja de responder -> sin heartbeat, el Controller sigue a ciegas.\nSensor manda valores erroneos -> decision erronea = desastre.\nController local cae -> refrigeracion y alertas del reactor se pierden.\nMain Controller se desconecta -> ningun reactor recibe comandos.\nRefrigeracion no responde -> no hay confirmacion ni alarma.\nRegistro/trazabilidad: no existe (\"quien prendio o apago que?\").\nLibreria nueva de eventos: si se cambia de golpe, P95/P99 desconocidos.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "L12e00130",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0.0,
   "y": 2080.0,
   "width": 1897.2800000000002,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "c026",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1129470,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 13814770,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Iteracion 3: To-be con reliability, fault tolerance y coexistencia con el legacy (reactor 1 migrado; 2 y 3 siguen legacy)",
   "originalText": "Iteracion 3: To-be con reliability, fault tolerance y coexistencia con el legacy (reactor 1 migrado; 2 y 3 siguen legacy)",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
